      "This is the best App for any level of rappers....... if there are 10 stars I will gladly give it to them.... such an exciting app ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️ It has increased my skill in freestyling and I hope y'all keep on getting better... the sky is the limit. 🖖🖖🤫",
